<title>NORWAY: Hydro awards Saipem oil contract.</title>
<headline>Hydro awards Saipem oil contract.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian industrial giant Norsk Hydro ASA said on Tuesday it had awarded Saipem UK Ltd a contract for 270 million crowns for work at the Oseberg East development in the North Sea.</p>
</text>
